{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey"},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/SQ","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s43ExpressibleByExtendedGraphemeClusterLiteralP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s32ExpressibleByStringInterpolationP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s26ExpressibleByStringLiteralP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s33ExpressibleByUnicodeScalarLiteralP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey\/init(_:)","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey\/init(stringInterpolation:)","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey\/init(stringLiteral:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey\/ExtendedGraphemeClusterLiteralType","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey\/StringLiteralType","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey\/UnicodeScalarLiteralType"],"generated":true,"title":"Type Aliases","anchor":"Type-Aliases"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey\/Equatable-Implementations","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey\/ExpressibleByExtendedGraphemeClusterLiteral-Implementations","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey\/ExpressibleByStringInterpolation-Implementations","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey\/ExpressibleByStringLiteral-Implementations"],"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LocalizedStringKey"}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Initializers for several OpenSwiftUI types – such as "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"Toggle","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Picker"},{"type":"text","text":" and others –  implicitly look up a localized string when you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provide a string literal. When you use the initializer "},{"code":"Text(\"Hello\")","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OpenSwiftUI creates a "},{"code":"LocalizedStringKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for you and uses that to look up a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"localization of the "},{"code":"Hello","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" string. This works because "},{"code":"LocalizedStringKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"conforms to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Swift\/ExpressibleByStringLiteral"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Types whose initializers take a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LocalizedStringKey"},{"type":"text","text":" usually have"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a corresponding initializer that accepts a parameter that conforms to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Swift\/StringProtocol"},{"type":"text","text":". Passing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String"},{"type":"text","text":" variable to these initializers avoids localization, which is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"usually appropriate when the variable contains a user-provided value."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"As a general rule, use a string literal argument when you want"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"localization, and a string variable argument when you don’t. In the case"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"where you want to localize the value of a string variable, use the string to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"create a new "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LocalizedStringKey"},{"type":"text","text":" instance."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example shows how to create "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text"},{"type":"text","text":" instances both"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with and without localization. The title parameter provided to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Section"},{"text":" is a literal string, so OpenSwiftUI creates a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"LocalizedStringKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for it. However, the string entries in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"messageStore.today","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" array are ","type":"text"},{"code":"String","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" variables, so the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text","type":"reference"},{"text":" views","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in the list use the string values verbatim.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["List {","    Section(header: Text(\"Today\")) {","        ForEach(messageStore.today) { message in","            Text(message.title)","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the app is localized into Japanese with the following"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"translation of its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Localizable.strings"},{"text":" file:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"other","code":["\"Today\" = \"今日\";"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When run in Japanese, the example produces a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"list like the following, localizing “Today” for the section header, but not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the list items."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/localizedstringkey"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"LocalizedStringKey","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"title":"LocalizedStringKey","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"LocalizedStringKey","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI18LocalizedStringKeyV"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI"]]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The key used to look up an entry in a strings file or strings dictionary","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"file.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/s32ExpressibleByStringInterpolationP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s32ExpressibleByStringInterpolationP","title":"Swift.ExpressibleByStringInterpolation"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/LocalizedStringKey/init(stringInterpolation:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Open